*---------------------- EXTENDED HEADER FIELD
* LNMODE 3 = HCN (hell charge note). Same chart structure as Mode 1 / 2,
* but the engine drains the groove gauge at ~2.5 %/sec for every interval
* the player is NOT actively holding the LN. Sustained holds gain gauge
* at the same rate, so a perfect hold-through pattern is gauge-neutral.

#PLAYER 1
#LNTYPE 1
#LNMODE 3
#LNOBJ ZZ

